{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "AI Provider Gateway API",
    "version": "0.11.1",
    "description": "REST API dla chat completions (JSON) oraz streamingu (SSE) nad adapterami Anthropic / Google Gemini.\n\n**Zakres produktu:** rdzeń MVP = routing + chat + streaming; providery MVP = Anthropic + Google Gemini. **System prompt** jest składany po stronie serwera z plików w `src/config/system-prompt/` (warstwy MASTER / MAIN / opcjonalnie per alias); w `messages[]` dozwolone są wyłącznie role `user` i `assistant` — patrz `docs/konfiguracja.md`, `docs/architektura.md`.\n\n**Odporność (`ResilientExecutor`):** dla każdego aliasu z `gateway.config.yaml` stosowane są `policy.timeoutMs`, `policy.retry.maxAttempts` i `policy.retry.onStatus` (domyślnie z `RETRY_POLICY_DEFAULTS` w `src/common/retry-policy-defaults.ts`). Retry dotyczy wyłącznie błędów HTTP z listy `onStatus` (domyślnie 429, 500, 502, 503, 504). Po wyczerpaniu prób na aliasie pierwszym, opcjonalnie **`models[].fallback`** uruchamia drugi alias (bez pętli — walidacja Zod przy starcie + `assertNoFallbackCycle` w runtime). Przy sukcesie na fallbacku odpowiedź zawiera opcjonalne **`effectiveModelAlias`**. Timeout → **504** (`PROVIDER_TIMEOUT`). Szczegóły: `docs/konfiguracja.md`, `docs/dokumentacja_api.md`.\n\n**Auth i limity na brzegu:** endpointy **`POST /api/v1/chat`** i **`POST /api/v1/chat/stream`** używają **`@GatewayKeyAndSmartRateLimit()`**: **`GatewayKeyGuard`** + **`SmartRateLimitGuard`**. Nagłówek: `X-Gateway-Key`; allowlista z `masterKeyRef` i niepustych `clients[].gatewayKeyRef` w `gateway.config.yaml`. Health bez klucza. Błędy klucza: **401** (`GATEWAY_KEY_MISSING`), **403** (`GATEWAY_KEY_INVALID`), **500** (`GATEWAY_KEY_NOT_CONFIGURED`).\n\n**Smart rate limiting** (`src/rate-limit/`, `RATE_LIMIT_SMART_ENABLED=true`, Redis): token bucket per `X-Gateway-Key`, limit równoległych streamów; limity z `clients[].rateLimit` w `gateway.config.yaml` lub domyślne z env (`RATE_LIMIT_RPS_PER_KEY`, `RATE_LIMIT_BURST_PER_KEY`, `RATE_LIMIT_STREAMS_CONCURRENT`). Cooldown po 429 od providera (czat standardowy) — **`RATE_LIMITED`**. Bez `@nestjs/throttler`. Health bez limitów. Szczegóły: `docs/konfiguracja.md`.\n\n**Format błędów:** envelope **`ErrorEnvelope`** (`GlobalExceptionFilter`). Słownik: `docs/dictionary.md`.\n\n**`requestId`:** **`RequestIdMiddleware`** — nagłówek **`x-request-id`** jeśli niepusty, inaczej `req_<uuid>`.\n\n**Cache (`POST /api/v1/chat`):** `noop` / `redis` — **`cached`**, **`cachedAt`**. Streaming bez cache.\n\n**Walidacja body:** `messages` 1–150, `content` max 3000 znaków; **`conversationId`** opcjonalnie w formacie `conv_<uuid>`; **`params`** z `allowOverrides` / `bounds`. **Response:** zawsze `conversationId` (echo lub `conv_<uuid>`). **Sentry:** `gen_ai.conversation.id` tylko gdy klient poda `conversationId` w request. `ValidationPipe` + limit JSON **1 MB**.\n\n**Planowane (Faza 5):** response header `x-request-id` — `docs/dokumentacja_koncepcyjna.md`."
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "http://localhost:3000",
      "description": "Przykład lokalny"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    { "name": "Health", "description": "Liveness i readiness" },
    { "name": "Chat", "description": "Chat completions (standard + streaming)" }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/health": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Health"],
        "operationId": "getHealth",
        "summary": "Liveness",
        "description": "Lekki probe procesu (`HealthService.getLiveness`). Nie wymaga `X-Gateway-Key`.",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Proces działa",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthLivenessResponse" },
                "examples": {
                  "ok": {
                    "value": {
                      "status": "healthy",
                      "timestamp": "2026-05-19T12:00:00.000Z"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/health/ready": {
      "get": {
        "tags": ["Health"],
        "operationId": "getHealthReady",
        "summary": "Readiness",
        "description": "Gotowość do obsługi ruchu (`HealthService.getReadiness`): konfiguracja gateway, opcjonalnie Redis (degraded gdy niedostępny). **HTTP zawsze 200** — ocena po polu `status` w body (`ready` / `not_ready`). Nie wymaga `X-Gateway-Key`.",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "JSON readiness; pole `status` w body (`ready` | `not_ready`), nie kod HTTP",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthReadinessResponse" },
                "examples": {
                  "ready": {
                    "value": {
                      "status": "ready",
                      "timestamp": "2026-05-19T12:00:00.000Z",
                      "version": "1.0.0",
                      "uptime": 42,
                      "checks": {
                        "config": { "status": "healthy", "message": "Config is loaded" },
                        "redis": { "status": "degraded", "message": "Redis unavailable (graceful degradation)" }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/chat": {
      "post": {
        "security": [{ "GatewayKeyAuth": [] }],
        "tags": ["Chat"],
        "operationId": "postChat",
        "summary": "Chat (standard)",
        "description": "Pełna odpowiedź JSON. `requestId` z `RequestIdMiddleware`. Parametry wywołania (`temperature`, `maxOutputTokens`): domyślnie z `policy.params.defaults` w YAML; opcjonalne **`params`** w body nadpisują dozwolone pola (`allowOverrides`) i są obcinane do `bounds`. Pole **`model`** = żądany `modelAlias`; przy fallbackie opcjonalnie **`effectiveModelAlias`** (alias faktycznie użyty).\n\n**Warstwa wywołania providera:** `ChatService` (cache, limity, `ResilientExecutor`) → `ChatProviderCallService.completeOnce` (system prompt, `ProviderChatInput`, metryki LLM).\n\n**Odporność:** `ResilientExecutor` — retry na aliasie pierwszym (`policy.retry`), potem opcjonalnie alias z `fallback` w YAML (np. `claude-sonnet` → `chat-default`). Timeout z `policy.timeoutMs` → **504** (`PROVIDER_TIMEOUT`).\n\n**`conversationId`:** w odpowiedzi zawsze (echo lub `conv_<uuid>` w formacie RFC UUID). W **request** opcjonalne — włącza grupowanie Sentry. Szczegóły: `docs/conversation-tracking.md`.\n\nOpcjonalny cache (tylko gdy provider i alias są włączone w YAML); smart rate limit / cooldown (`RATE_LIMITED`).",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatRequest" },
              "examples": {
                "minimal": {
                  "value": {
                    "modelAlias": "chat-default",
                    "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "Napisz krótkie streszczenie." }]
                  }
                },
                "multiTurn": {
                  "value": {
                    "modelAlias": "chat-default",
                    "messages": [
                      { "role": "user", "content": "Czym jest gateway?" },
                      { "role": "assistant", "content": "Warstwa pośrednia między klientem a LLM." },
                      { "role": "user", "content": "Podsumuj w jednym zdaniu." }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "firstTurnNoConversationId": {
                  "summary": "Tura 1 — bez conversationId w request (Sentry: pojedynczy span)",
                  "value": {
                    "modelAlias": "chat-default",
                    "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "Wypisz 2 fakty o Polsce." }]
                  }
                },
                "secondTurnWithConversation": {
                  "summary": "Tura 2+ — conversationId + pełna historia w messages[]",
                  "value": {
                    "modelAlias": "chat-default",
                    "conversationId": "conv_123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
                    "messages": [
                      { "role": "user", "content": "Wypisz 2 fakty o Polsce." },
                      { "role": "assistant", "content": "Polska leży w Europie Środkowej..." },
                      { "role": "user", "content": "A o Warszawie?" }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                "withParams": {
                  "summary": "Override parametrów generacji (allowOverrides + bounds z YAML)",
                  "value": {
                    "modelAlias": "chat-default",
                    "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "Krótko." }],
                    "params": { "temperature": 0.7, "maxOutputTokens": 256 }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Odpowiedź gateway (standard)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatResponse" },
                "examples": {
                  "okText": {
                    "value": {
                      "id": "gw_01H...",
                      "provider": "anthropic",
                      "model": "chat-default",
                      "output": { "type": "text", "text": "..." },
                      "usage": { "inputTokens": 123, "outputTokens": 456 },
                      "requestId": "req_...",
                      "conversationId": "conv_123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Walidacja DTO, nieznany `modelAlias` (`MODEL_ALIAS_NOT_FOUND`), niedozwolony override w `params` (`MODEL_NOT_ALLOWED`), `STREAMING_NOT_SUPPORTED` (nie dotyczy tego endpointu) lub inny `400` z jawnym `code`.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope" },
                "examples": {
                  "validationFailed": {
                    "value": {
                      "statusCode": 400,
                      "code": "VALIDATION_FAILED",
                      "message": "modelAlias must be a string",
                      "requestId": "req_01H...",
                      "details": []
                    }
                  },
                  "unknownAlias": {
                    "value": {
                      "statusCode": 400,
                      "code": "MODEL_ALIAS_NOT_FOUND",
                      "message": "Model alias unknown-alias not found in config",
                      "requestId": "req_01H...",
                      "details": []
                    }
                  },
                  "invalidConversationId": {
                    "value": {
                      "statusCode": 400,
                      "code": "VALIDATION_FAILED",
                      "message": "conversationId must be conv_<uuid>",
                      "requestId": "req_01H...",
                      "details": []
                    }
                  },
                  "paramNotAllowed": {
                    "value": {
                      "statusCode": 400,
                      "code": "MODEL_NOT_ALLOWED",
                      "message": "Parameter temperature is not allowed for this model alias",
                      "requestId": "req_01H...",
                      "details": [{ "field": "params.temperature", "allowOverrides": [] }]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Brak nagłówka `X-Gateway-Key` (`GATEWAY_KEY_MISSING`).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope" },
                "examples": {
                  "missingKey": {
                    "value": {
                      "statusCode": 401,
                      "code": "GATEWAY_KEY_MISSING",
                      "message": "Missing X-Gateway-Key header value.",
                      "requestId": "req_01H...",
                      "details": []
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Niepoprawny `X-Gateway-Key` (`GATEWAY_KEY_INVALID`).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope" },
                "examples": {
                  "invalidKey": {
                    "value": {
                      "statusCode": 403,
                      "code": "GATEWAY_KEY_INVALID",
                      "message": "Invalid X-Gateway-Key header value.",
                      "requestId": "req_01H...",
                      "details": []
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "Limit gateway: smart rate limit per klucz (`RATE_LIMITED`) lub mapowanie 429 od providera (`PROVIDER_RATE_LIMITED`).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope" },
                "examples": {
                  "rateLimited": {
                    "value": {
                      "statusCode": 429,
                      "code": "RATE_LIMITED",
                      "message": "Rate limit exceeded",
                      "requestId": "req_01H...",
                      "details": []
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "504": {
            "description": "Przekroczony `policy.timeoutMs` (`PROVIDER_TIMEOUT`) lub mapowanie 504 od providera.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope" },
                "examples": {
                  "providerTimeout": {
                    "value": {
                      "statusCode": 504,
                      "code": "PROVIDER_TIMEOUT",
                      "message": "Request timeout after 30000ms",
                      "requestId": "req_01H...",
                      "details": []
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "M.in. `PROVIDER_UNSUPPORTED` lub `PROVIDER_UNAVAILABLE` (mapper SDK / wyczerpanie retry+fallback).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope" },
                "examples": {
                  "providerUnsupported": {
                    "value": {
                      "statusCode": 502,
                      "code": "PROVIDER_UNSUPPORTED",
                      "message": "Provider google not registered.",
                      "requestId": "req_01H...",
                      "details": []
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Nieobsłużony wyjątek lub `GATEWAY_KEY_NOT_CONFIGURED`.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope" },
                "examples": {
                  "internalError": {
                    "value": {
                      "statusCode": 500,
                      "code": "INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR",
                      "message": "An unexpected error occurred",
                      "requestId": "req_01H...",
                      "details": []
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/chat/stream": {
      "post": {
        "security": [{ "GatewayKeyAuth": [] }],
        "tags": ["Chat"],
        "operationId": "postChatStream",
        "summary": "Chat (streaming)",
        "description": "SSE (`text/event-stream`): `meta` → `delta`* → `done` (pusty `{}`).\n\nTen sam body i kontrakt co `POST /api/v1/chat` (w tym retry/fallback przez `ResilientExecutor`). Wywołanie providera: `ChatProviderCallService.streamOnce` (emit `meta`/`delta`, metryki stream). W **`meta`**: `model` = żądany alias; opcjonalnie **`effectiveModelAlias`** po fallbacku; zawsze **`conversationId`** (echo lub `conv_<uuid>`).\n\n**JSON `ErrorEnvelope` przed `flushHeaders`:** walidacja, guardy, **`validateForStreaming`**. **Po `flushHeaders`:** m.in. `MODEL_NOT_ALLOWED` (`params` w `resolveProviderCallOptions` w `streamOnce`), błędy providera (`PROVIDER_*`), timeout — częściowy SSE zamiast JSON. Brak cooldownu po 429 jak w czacie standardowym. **`StreamCleanupInterceptor`** w `finalize`. Patrz `docs/conversation-tracking.md`, `docs/dokumentacja_api.md`.",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatRequest" },
              "examples": {
                "minimal": {
                  "value": {
                    "modelAlias": "chat-default",
                    "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "Powiedz coś krótko." }]
                  }
                },
                "withConversationId": {
                  "value": {
                    "modelAlias": "chat-default",
                    "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "Powiedz coś krótko." }],
                    "conversationId": "conv_123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000"
                  }
                },
                "withParams": {
                  "summary": "Override parametrów (jak POST /chat)",
                  "value": {
                    "modelAlias": "chat-default",
                    "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "Powiedz coś krótko." }],
                    "params": { "temperature": 0.5, "maxOutputTokens": 512 }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "SSE stream",
            "content": {
              "text/event-stream": {
                "schema": { "type": "string", "description": "Strumień SSE. Każde zdarzenie: `event: <name>\\ndata: <json>\\n\\n`." },
                "examples": {
                  "sse": {
                    "value": "event: meta\ndata: {\"id\":\"gw_01H...\",\"provider\":\"anthropic\",\"model\":\"claude-sonnet\",\"effectiveModelAlias\":\"chat-default\",\"requestId\":\"req_...\",\"conversationId\":\"conv_123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\":\"Cześć\"}\n\nevent: delta\ndata: {\"text\":\"!\"}\n\nevent: done\ndata: {}\n"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Walidacja DTO, niedozwolony override w `params` (`MODEL_NOT_ALLOWED`) lub błąd domenowy z `validateForStreaming` (przed SSE) — JSON `ErrorEnvelope`.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope" },
                "examples": {
                  "validationFailed": {
                    "value": {
                      "statusCode": 400,
                      "code": "VALIDATION_FAILED",
                      "message": "messages must contain no more than 150 elements",
                      "requestId": "req_01H...",
                      "details": []
                    }
                  },
                  "streamingNotSupported": {
                    "value": {
                      "statusCode": 400,
                      "code": "STREAMING_NOT_SUPPORTED",
                      "message": "Streaming not supported for this model.",
                      "requestId": "req_01H...",
                      "details": []
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Brak `X-Gateway-Key` (przed SSE).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope" }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Niepoprawny `X-Gateway-Key` (przed SSE).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope" }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "Smart rate limit (`RATE_LIMITED`) — przed SSE.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelope" }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "GatewayKeyAuth": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-Gateway-Key",
        "description": "Klucz klienta gateway (allowlista z `gateway.config.yaml` + env). Chronione endpointy używają `@GatewayKeyAndSmartRateLimit()`."
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "HealthLivenessResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["status", "timestamp"],
        "properties": {
          "status": { "type": "string", "const": "healthy" },
          "timestamp": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "description": "ISO 8601 UTC (`new Date().toISOString()` w `HealthService.getLiveness` i `getReadiness`)."
          }
        }
      },
      "HealthCheckItem": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["status", "message"],
        "properties": {
          "status": { "type": "string", "enum": ["healthy", "degraded", "unhealthy"] },
          "message": { "type": "string" }
        }
      },
      "HealthReadinessResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["status", "timestamp", "version", "uptime", "checks"],
        "properties": {
          "status": { "type": "string", "enum": ["ready", "not_ready"] },
          "timestamp": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "description": "ISO 8601 UTC (`toISOString()` w `HealthService.getReadiness`)."
          },
          "version": { "type": "string" },
          "uptime": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "description": "Czas działania procesu w sekundach (`process.uptime()`)." },
          "checks": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "properties": {
              "config": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthCheckItem" },
              "redis": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthCheckItem" }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "ErrorEnvelope": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["statusCode", "code", "message", "requestId"],
        "description": "Envelope błędów z `GlobalExceptionFilter`. Pole `message` jest zawsze stringiem (walidacja: `join('; ')`).",
        "properties": {
          "statusCode": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 400, "maximum": 599 },
          "code": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Kod maszynowy z payloadu wyjątku lub `DEFAULT_HTTP_STATUS_TO_CODE`. Słownik: `docs/dictionary.md`."
          },
          "message": { "type": "string" },
          "requestId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Z `RequestIdMiddleware` lub z payloadu wyjątku (guardy)."
          },
          "details": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "Obecna implementacja zawsze emituje pustą tablicę.",
            "items": {}
          }
        }
      },
      "ChatRole": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["user", "assistant"],
        "description": "Rola `system` w API jest zablokowana — system prompt z plików w `src/config/system-prompt/`."
      },
      "ChatMessage": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["role", "content"],
        "properties": {
          "role": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatRole" },
          "content": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 3000 }
        }
      },
      "ChatParams": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "temperature": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 2,
            "description": "Override; dozwolone tylko gdy alias ma `temperature` w `policy.params.allowOverrides`."
          },
          "maxOutputTokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 8192,
            "description": "Override; dozwolone tylko gdy alias ma `maxOutputTokens` w `allowOverrides`."
          }
        }
      },
      "ChatRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["modelAlias", "messages"],
        "properties": {
          "modelAlias": { "type": "string" },
          "messages": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 150,
            "items": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatMessage" }
          },
          "conversationId": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^conv_[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[1-5][0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$",
            "description": "Opcjonalny identyfikator sesji w formacie `conv_<uuid>` (`ChatRequestDto`). **W request:** włącza `gen_ai.conversation.id` w Sentry; wymaga pełnej historii w `messages[]` od tury 2. **Gdy pominięty:** Sentry = pojedyncza wiadomość; gateway zwraca nowe `conv_<uuid>` w odpowiedzi. Zob. `docs/conversation-tracking.md`.",
            "example": "conv_123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000"
          },
          "params": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatParams"
          }
        }
      },
      "SseMetaPayload": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["id", "provider", "model", "requestId", "conversationId"],
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
          "provider": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
          "model": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "description": "Żądany `modelAlias` z body." },
          "effectiveModelAlias": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "Obecne tylko gdy `ResilientExecutor` obsłużył żądanie na aliasie `fallback` z YAML (inny niż `model`)."
          },
          "requestId": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
          "conversationId": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "ID sesji zwrócone klientowi (echo `conversationId` z body lub `conv_<uuid>` gdy brak w request). Grupowanie Sentry wymaga podania tego samego ID w body żądania."
          }
        }
      },
      "SseDeltaPayload": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["text"],
        "properties": {
          "text": { "type": "string" }
        }
      },
      "SseDonePayload": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "Runtime emituje pusty obiekt; `usage` w streamingu planowane.",
        "properties": {}
      },
      "ChatOutputText": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["type", "text"],
        "properties": {
          "type": { "type": "string", "const": "text" },
          "text": { "type": "string" }
        }
      },
      "ChatUsage": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "inputTokens": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
          "outputTokens": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 },
          "totalTokens": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 }
        }
      },
      "ChatResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": ["id", "provider", "model", "output", "requestId", "conversationId"],
        "properties": {
          "id": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
          "provider": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
          "model": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "description": "Żądany `modelAlias` z body." },
          "effectiveModelAlias": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "Obecne tylko po udanym fallbacku (`models[].fallback` w YAML) — alias faktycznie użyty do wywołania providera."
          },
          "output": {
            "oneOf": [{ "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatOutputText" }]
          },
          "usage": { "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatUsage" },
          "requestId": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1 },
          "conversationId": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "ID sesji zwrócone klientowi (echo `conversationId` z body lub `conv_<uuid>` gdy brak w request). Grupowanie w Sentry wymaga podania tego samego ID w body kolejnych żądań — patrz `docs/conversation-tracking.md`."
          },
          "cached": { "type": "boolean", "const": true },
          "cachedAt": { "type": "string", "format": "date-time" }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
